<section id="advanced-tracking" class="analytics-advanced-tracking">
    <div class="customContainer">
        <div class="advanced-tracking-holder">
            <article class="advanced-tracking-img">
                <img src="/assets/images/services/google-analytics-consultant/advanced-tracking-desktop.webp" alt="Advanced Tracking pic">
            </article>
            <article class="advanced-tracking-content">
                <h2>Advanced tracking implementation will help you minimize data loss</h2>
                <p>
                    Every business is unique, and so are its data requirements. Our Google Analytics consultants understand this and work closely with both small business owners and enterprise clients to develop customized tracking and reporting solutions that align with specific business objectives. By harnessing the power of advanced Google Analytics features, we help you better understand your website visitors and their behavior. We'll help you set up server-side tracking, cross-domain tracking, and Google Tag Manager to ensure your business captures the most relevant and accurate data possible. Here's a closer look at these advanced data collection methods:
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>

        <div class="advanced-tracking-boxes">
            <article class="box">
                <div class="box-header">
                    <img src="/assets/images/services/google-analytics-consultant/gtm-icon.svg" alt="GTM icon">
                    <h4>Google Tag Manager:</h4>
                </div>
                <p>
                    Google Tag Manager is a powerful tool that simplifies the process of managing and deploying tracking codes and tags on your website. Using Google Tag Manager, you can easily add, update, or remove tags without modifying your website's code directly. Our Google Analytics consultants can set up and configure Google Tag Manager for your business, streamlining the management of your tracking codes and ensuring that everything works smoothly.
                </p>
            </article>
            <article class="box">
                <div class="box-header">
                    <img src="/assets/images/services/google-analytics-consultant/tracking-2.svg" alt="icon">
                    <h4>Server-Side Tracking:</h4>
                </div>
                <p>
                    Server-side tracking lets you collect and send data directly from your server to Google Analytics, bypassing the user's browser. This method offers increased accuracy, privacy, and security in data collection, as it reduces the likelihood of data loss due to browser restrictions or ad blockers. Our Google Analytics consultants can help you set up server-side tracking to ensure you capture reliable business data only.
                </p>
            </article>
            <article class="box">
                <div class="box-header">
                    <img src="/assets/images/services/google-analytics-consultant/tracking-3.svg" alt="icon">
                    <h4>Cross-Domain Tracking:</h4>
                </div>
                <p>
                    If your website spans multiple domains, cross-domain tracking is essential for understanding how users interact with your content across these different domains. Our team can implement cross-domain tracking to provide you with a holistic view of your visitor behavior and help you optimize the user experience across your entire online presence.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>

    
