                    <h4>Audit and Assessment:</h4>
                </div>
                <p>
                    As a small business owner, maximizing your online visibility and making the most out of your digital marketing budget is critical to your success. Our Google Analytics consultants can provide actionable insights and tailored strategies to help you compete effectively against well-established corporations in the digital space.
                </p>
            </article>
            <article class="box">
                <div class="box-header">
                    <img src="/assets/images/services/google-analytics-consultant/universal-2.svg" alt="icon">
                    <h4>Actionable Recommendations:</h4>
                </div>
                <p>
                    Business-to-business organizations rely on effective digital marketing strategies to generate leads and build lasting client relationships. Our Google Analytics consulting services can help you understand your target audience, develop targeted marketing campaigns, and measure the success of your efforts.
                </p>
            </article>
            <article class="box">
                <div class="box-header">
                    <img src="/assets/images/services/google-analytics-consultant/benefits-2.svg" alt="icon">
                    <h4>In-Depth Data Analysis:</h4>
                </div>
                <p>
